        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Uhoraho abarira Mose, ati Rāba, ngira ngo ndabacuncuburire umutsima uvuye mw ijuru: uko bukeye abantu baze bame baja kwegeranya ivy’ uwo musi, kugira ngo mbagerageze ndābe yuko bitondera ivyagezwe vyanje, canke ko batavyitondera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
